abstract: >-
  Training and evaluation code, sealed-test evidence, experiments and analysis
  scripts behind the exploratory results reported for TrainDoctor, an
  environment for diagnosing and repairing failed distributed PyTorch training
  jobs. The environment and verifier live in the traindoctor-env library.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - RL environment
  - LLM agents
  - distributed training
  - verifiers
